ex="0" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8u2zjhvn/production/690df68b76dbc228fba092407207caedc24a07fb-261x54.svg?w=261&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" srcset="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8u2zjhvn/production/690df68b76dbc228fba092407207caedc24a07fb-261x54.svg?w=160&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 160w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8u2zjhvn/production/690df68b76dbc228fba092407207caedc24a07fb-261x54.svg?w=261&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 261w" sizes="8rem" alt="pro science logo" width="261" height="54" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424></li><li tabindex="0" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8u2zjhvn/production/ef0e7944efc0b3f7652c57ac775c681ff67477ed-249x64.svg?w=249&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" srcset="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8u2zjhvn/production/ef0e7944efc0b3f7652c57ac775c681ff67477ed-249x64.svg?w=160&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 160w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8u2zjhvn/production/ef0e7944efc0b3f7652c57ac775c681ff67477ed-249x64.svg?w=249&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 249w" sizes="8rem" alt="cash4car logo" width="249" height="64" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424></li><li tabindex="0" class="difference" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8u2zjhvn/production/f2d294031922c374c1697ba65ecc9d0d58fc67bd-411x103.svg?w=411&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" srcset="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8u2zjhvn/production/f2d294031922c374c1697ba65ecc9d0d58fc67bd-411x103.svg?w=160&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 160w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8u2zjhvn/production/f2d294031922c374c1697ba65ecc9d0d58fc67bd-411x103.svg?w=320&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 320w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8u2zjhvn/production/f2d294031922c374c1697ba65ecc9d0d58fc67bd-411x103.svg?w=411&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format 411w" sizes="8rem" alt="deky expo logo" width="411" height="103" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424></li></ul></div></div></section><section class="content-grid section feature" data-astro-cid-7wj36s4i><div class="block-inner" data-astro-cid-7wj36s4i><div class="feature-layout has-media" data-astro-cid-yr23l7fg><div class="copy" data-astro-cid-yr23l7fg><h2 id="prompty-przechodza-proces-zostaje" data-astro-cid-yr23l7fg="true">Prompty przechodzą. Proces zostaje.</h2><div class="pt prose flow" data-astro-cid-6amch4or><p data-astro-cid-6amch4or="true">Materiałów o AI jest dziś więcej niż czasu, żeby je obejrzeć. Problem jest gdzie indziej: po obejrzeniu nikt tego nie wdraża, bo nikt nie podpiął AI do CRM i nie zebrał tego, co firma wie o swoich klientach.<br>- AI nie zna waszego cennika, klientów ani sposobu komunikacji, więc pisze generyki.<br>- CRM, poczta i notatki ze spotkań są osobno, więc handlowiec dalej przenosi dane ręcznie.<br>- Dobre prompty zostają u jednej osoby i firma nie uczy się na kolejnych ofertach.<br>Dlatego każdy moduł kończy się gotowym rozwiązaniem, które zostaje w firmie: bazą wiedzy, podpiętą integracją, opisanym procesem.</p><p data-astro-cid-6amch4or="true">McKinsey podaje, że 88% organizacji regularnie używa AI, natomiast tylko 39% deklaruje jakikolwiek wpływ na EBIT, zwykle poniżej 5%<br>(McKinsey, State of AI 2025)</p></div></div><figure class="media" data-astro-cid-yr23l7fg><style>
/* ---- Shared family layer: tokens + responsive shell ---- */
  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] {
    --zw-primary:#3A48CC; --zw-primary-10:#EBEDFA; --zw-primary-30:#8991E0;
    --zw-secondary:#0ACFFE; --zw-success:#52C41A; --zw-bg-soft:#F9FAFB;
    --zw-border:#DDE1E6; --zw-border-soft:#EDF0F3; --zw-heading:#0E0F11;
    --zw-text:#1E2024; --zw-muted:#838D95; --zw-card:#FFFFFF;
    --zw-font:'Satoshi Variable','Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,system-ui,sans-serif;
    --zw-radius-card:10px; --zw-radius-lane:14px;
    --zw-shadow-rest:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
    font-family:var(--zw-font); width:100%; max-width:620px; margin:0 auto;
    box-sizing:border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] *, [data-diagram="zw-problem"] *::before, [data-diagram="zw-problem"] *::after { box-sizing:border-box; }
  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .zw-stage { width:100%; overflow:hidden; }
  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .zw-fit { width:640px; transform-origin:top left; }
  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .zw-scene { position:relative; }

  /* =================== SCENE:STYLE start =================== */
  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .pr-svg { display:block; width:100%; height:auto; overflow:visible; }
  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .pr-svg text { font-family:var(--zw-font); }

  /* axes + caption fade in */
  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .pr-axis { opacity:0; }
  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .pr-axis line { stroke:var(--zw-border); stroke-width:2; }
  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .pr-cap { fill:var(--zw-muted); font-size:15px; opacity:0; }
  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .pr-origin { fill:var(--zw-primary); opacity:0; }

  /* the two lines draw via dashoffset */
  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .pr-line { fill:none; stroke-width:5; stroke-linecap:round; stroke-dasharray:1; stroke-dashoffset:1; }
  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .pr-flat { stroke:var(--zw-primary); }
  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .pr-perc { stroke:var(--zw-secondary); }
  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .pr-enddot { opacity:0; }
  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .pr-flat-dot { fill:var(--zw-primary); }

  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .pr-arrow { fill:none; stroke:var(--zw-secondary); stroke-width:5; stroke-linecap:round; stroke-linejoin:round; opacity:0; transform-box:fill-box; }

  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .pr-lbl { font-size:17px; font-weight:640; opacity:0; }
  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .pr-lbl--flat { fill:var(--zw-primary); }
  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .pr-lbl--perc { fill:var(--zw-secondary); }

  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .pr-chip { opacity:0; transform-box:fill-box; transform-origin:center; }
  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .pr-chip rect { fill:var(--zw-secondary); }
  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .pr-chip text { fill:#fff; font-size:16px; font-weight:700; }

  /* the gap reveal */
  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .pr-area { fill:var(--zw-secondary); opacity:0; }
  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .pr-gapline { stroke:var(--zw-muted); stroke-width:2; stroke-dasharray:5 6; stroke-linecap:round; opacity:0; }
  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .pr-gaptag { opacity:0; transform-box:fill-box; transform-origin:center; }
  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .pr-gaptag rect { fill:var(--zw-card); stroke:var(--zw-border); stroke-width:1.5; }
  [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .pr-gaptag text { fill:var(--zw-text); font-size:15px; font-weight:700; }
  /* ==================== SCENE:STYLE end ==================== */

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .pr-axis, [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .pr-cap, [data-diagram="zw-problem"] .pr-origin,
